1
00:00:00,493 --> 00:00:03,993
Pretty cool, huh? Probably would have
cost, like, 200 bucks in a store.

2
00:00:04,163 --> 00:00:05,663
(Amy:)I do appreciate a bargain.

3
00:00:05,832 --> 00:00:09,422
(Amy:)This entire ensemble
once belonged to my dead grandmother.

4
00:00:09,585 --> 00:00:12,755
- You're kidding?
- Everything except bra and panties.

5
00:00:12,922 --> 00:00:16,422
(Amy:)They're a leopard-spotted secret
I share with Victoria.

6
00:00:17,552 --> 00:00:19,512
And now me, heh.

7
00:00:20,722 --> 00:00:22,852
(Amy:)I just have one question
about the chair.

8
00:00:23,016 --> 00:00:24,556
(Penny:)And what's that?

9
00:00:24,726 --> 00:00:27,686
(Amy:)Aren't you worried about it
being unhygienic?

10
00:00:29,605 --> 00:00:32,145
(Penny:)No. It's completely fi...

11
00:00:33,234 --> 00:00:34,614
(Penny:)Hmm.

12
00:00:34,777 --> 00:00:38,157
(Penny:)I get it. Sheldon sent you.
He put you up to this.

13
00:00:38,322 --> 00:00:39,452
- No, he didn't.
- Really?

14
00:00:39,615 --> 00:00:42,365
(Amy:)Yes, he did, he absolutely did.

15
00:00:43,369 --> 00:00:45,909
Oh, my God, Amy,
that's really crappy of you.

16
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:47,330
- It is?
- Yeah.

17
00:00:47,498 --> 00:00:49,748
(Penny:)Letting Sheldon use you
to manipulate me?

18
00:00:49,917 --> 00:00:51,337
(Penny:)I thought you were my friend.

19
00:00:51,502 --> 00:00:54,022
(Amy:)No, I am your friend.
Please don't be mad at me.

